OL,3,AEU and Nato vow to step up pressure on
OL,4,ARussia after 'new escalation' in
OL,5,AGermany
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We have to step up and that means
OL,8,Fbeing ready to respond to Russia's
OL,9,Frecklessness faster and better," von
OL,10,Fder Leyen said. Nato Secretary General
OL,11,FMark Rutte said the whole alliance,
OL,12,Fwhich includes the US, stood "in full
OL,13,Fsolidarity with Germany".
OL,15,FRussia has rejected German accusations
OL,16,Fthat a drone carrying explosives
OL,17,Fdeliberately targeted a Ukrainian cargo
OL,18,Fplane on 4 August.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
